    <briefdescription>
<para>A mock class satisfying the interface expected by <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_release_mode_model_runner" kindref="compound">ReleaseModeModelRunner</ref> for its <computeroutput>TGen</computeroutput> parameter. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Useful to avoid conditional compilation complexity, as a compile-time replacement for a real AOT-ed model. </para>
